Surround yourself with a shield that will absorb 40% of any fire/cold/light/arcane attack, up to a maximum of [58, 79, 94, 108, 120 (TL1-5; MP 100)] damage per attack.

Every time your shield absorbs damage, you convert some of the attack into energy, gaining one point of Psi, plus an additional point for every [71, 62, 54, 47, 42 (TL1-5; MP 100)] points of damage absorbed, up to a maximum [2.3, 2.5, 2.7, 2.9, 3.0 (TL1-5)] points each turn.

At talent level 3, when you de-activate the shield twice the absorbed damage (if any) in the last 3 turns is released as a full psionic shield (absorbing all damage).

The maximum amount of damage your shield can absorb and the efficiency of the psi gain scale with your mindpower.

You can only have two of these shields active at once.
